  "Name": "Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes - Okta Identity Provider Created",
  "Description": "Alert: Alert - Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes\nMITRE ATT&CK: Persistence / T1556.007\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Identity Provider Created\" or \"<ip>|Okta Identity Provider Created\"\n\nDetects when a new identity provider is created for Okta.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_identity_provider_created/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/okta_identity_provider_created.yml",
